Prior work this project learned from
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

odynsscomp is an independent Rust reimplementation of the NWScript compiler
that KOTOR modders know as `nwnnsscomp.exe`. It contains no code from that
program or from any of its ancestors. It does reproduce their observable
behaviour deliberately, and its grammar, lexical rules and diagnostic strings
were derived from reading the sources below.

