The KOTOR build of `nwnnsscomp.exe` is a fork of that work, modified by
Hazard and then by tk102 for stoffe (v0.03b). Where the fork's behaviour and
the published sources disagree, odynsscomp follows the fork, because that is
the compiler existing mod source was written against. Those places are marked
`KOTOR-DIVERGENCE` in the code.

